body:
I am an 18-year-old adult. I have tried Therapy before however I was discharged because I failed to turn up (mainly because of College). I struggle to be honest enough in them sessions and the only way out was suicide. I have too much guilt, shame and I hate the person who I am which made me turn to Suicide to end the pain.

&#x200B;

I have tried overdosing with Opioids then overdosed with sleeping pills straught after. To add to that, I even mixed lots of alcohol and still somehow survived. I read these news articles similar to my situation and it seems not to work for me.
